            { "text": "プロジェクト パスを指定せずに起動すると、プロジェクトは未読み込みの状態になる", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified", "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/dynamics365/business-central/dev-itpro/developer/al-agent-tools/al-mcp-server", "locator": "Starting the server", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-15T17:00:00Z" }] },
